# Big Data Lab — Unit III: Pig Word Count Program

## 1. Create the Input Text File

nano wordcount.txt

hello hadoop
hello pig
hadoop pig
hello hadoop

## 2. Create a Directory in HDFS

hdfs dfs -mkdir -p /data/pig/wordcount

## 3. Upload the Local File to HDFS

hdfs dfs -put wordcount.txt /data/pig/wordcount/

## 4. Display the File in HDFS

hdfs dfs -cat /data/pig/wordcount/wordcount.txt

## 5. Start Pig

pig

## 6. Load the Text File

lines = LOAD '/data/pig/wordcount/wordcount.txt' USING TextLoader() AS (line:chararray);

## 7. Tokenize the Lines into Words

words = FOREACH lines GENERATE FLATTEN(TOKENIZE(line)) AS word;

## 8. Group Identical Words

grouped_words = GROUP words BY word;

## 9. Count the Occurrences of Each Word

word_count = FOREACH grouped_words GENERATE group, COUNT(words);

## 10. Display the Word Count

DUMP word_count;
